Right now we have info, customer, attachments, and notes tabs. Lets add into the Ticket History, this will be where we show the history of the ticket, such as previous tickets that were related to this one. How 811 handles them is a new ticket is a "Normal", then updates and update remarks get new ticket numbers but are descendants of the original ticket, but treated as a "new ticket". So in this tab we can show a list of related ticket and allow the user to click on any of them to view the details, these cannot be edited tho by a regular technician. It will just show marked status of the customers, attachments, and notes for that ticket. ALSO in the notes tab, we should display ALL notes related to that ticket string. SO if a note was attached to the normal, the update remark notes will show that note as well on the notes tab. In the attachments tab, we will have 2 ways of attaching images, camera, or gallery. The camera button will open the users camera to allow for images to be taken and attached automatically (if possible) and the gallery will open the users gallery, allow for select all, or custom select, with an attach button to confirm, and any selected will be attached to that ticket with auto deletion of those images from the users gallery after ticket closure. Also after closing a ticket, lets automatically take the user back to the ticket list view
